<title>PERU: TABLE - Telefonica del Peru Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Telefonica del Peru Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADS -	     $0.386 vs   $0.282</p>
<p>    Share -	0.103 sol vs    0.075 sol</p>
<p>    Net -  239.9 million soles vs    175.5 million soles</p>
<p>    Revs - 952.2 million soles vs    775.5 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Telefonica is Peru's leading telecommunications company and the Lima Stock Exchange's benchmark stock. The firm is controlled by Telefonica de Espana.</p>
<p>((--Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
